WEBVTT

00:07.960 --> 00:10.280
It's all right! Your big sister's here!

00:10.280 --> 00:11.850
If you're gonna attack, bring it!

00:14.110 --> 00:15.360
You're fighting me!

00:18.970 --> 00:20.870
Use this chance to get away, Asahi!

00:20.870 --> 00:21.870
Oneechan!

00:31.070 --> 00:33.560
H-Hey, stop it. That tickles.

00:33.560 --> 00:36.760
Oh! Kyuu-chan! So <i>this</i> is where you were.

00:37.800 --> 00:40.780
Jeez, where'd you run off to? 
I've been looking everywhere.

00:41.310 --> 00:42.600
Well, shucks.

00:42.600 --> 00:46.250
Aw, my clothes are covered in mud.
 I'm gonna get yelled at.

00:46.250 --> 00:47.560
Don't you think, Asahi?

00:51.240 --> 00:52.280
Asahi?

00:52.730 --> 00:55.670
E-Everything's okay now! 
There's no need to be scared! Okay?

00:56.950 --> 00:58.490
I-I...

00:59.380 --> 01:03.410
Maya-oneechan... I couldn't protect you...

01:09.210 --> 01:10.540
Asahi...

