<b>Sister</b>

02:45.010 --> 02:47.900
<b>and Little 
\h\hBrother</b>

02:49.410 --> 02:50.650
Emergency quest!

02:50.650 --> 02:54.520
The Demon King's monsters are heading towards
 a remote village to the north-northwest!

02:54.520 --> 02:56.150
It's your time to shine, Asahi-kun!

02:56.150 --> 02:58.990
If you find a human, 
tear 'em limb from limb!

03:03.540 --> 03:06.710
That damn Demon King's army,
just doing whatever they like!

03:06.710 --> 03:08.290
I'm going back to the village and—

03:08.290 --> 03:11.040
Forget it! We can't do 
a thing against foes like that!

03:11.040 --> 03:12.610
But...

03:13.070 --> 03:16.130
Village Elder, what about the adventurers?

03:16.130 --> 03:19.090
They stayed in the village to protect us.

03:19.090 --> 03:22.550
They're trying to slow the 
monsters down, even if only a little.

03:22.770 --> 03:24.030
But they'll...

03:24.030 --> 03:26.560
Ikusaba Asahi and his older sister...

03:26.830 --> 03:30.810
He possesses the spirit of a hero.

03:31.710 --> 03:34.380
We shall never, ever forget you.

03:41.990 --> 03:45.820
I serve one of the Demon King's Six Generals,
 Giganto of the Hundred Beasts.

03:45.820 --> 03:47.620
I am Stelopeth the cyclops.

03:47.910 --> 03:53.120
This village is mine now. It will serve
 as a stepping stone for the invasion of—

03:53.120 --> 03:55.330
Big Sis Fire!

04:00.260 --> 04:02.090
S-Stelopeth-sama has been defeated!

04:02.090 --> 04:03.550
Y-You can't be serious!

04:03.550 --> 04:05.480
Sh-She's a monster!

04:05.480 --> 04:07.050
Run away!

04:08.080 --> 04:10.640
Maya-nee, the monsters just called you a monster.

04:10.640 --> 04:12.270
Talk about rude.

04:14.250 --> 04:15.690
Who are they?

04:15.690 --> 04:18.360
They seem to be monsters that 
were too slow to escape.

04:18.360 --> 04:19.540
Okay!

04:19.540 --> 04:21.930
Leave these guys to me!

04:21.930 --> 04:23.530
Oh, you seem all fired up, Asahi!

04:26.950 --> 04:29.070
Wh-What are they doing?

04:29.070 --> 04:30.410
That's a strange dance.

04:31.010 --> 04:32.670
Are they begging for their lives?

04:33.530 --> 04:37.150
I feel a little sorry for them, 
but that won't work on me!

04:48.300 --> 04:49.510
What's wrong, Asahi?

04:52.000 --> 04:53.560
Maya-oneechan!

04:53.560 --> 04:54.890
A-Asahi?!

04:55.960 --> 04:58.810
Maya-oneechan, I love you!

05:00.650 --> 05:04.420
<i>Finally... My love has finally
reached my little brother!</i>

05:05.030 --> 05:08.030
I love you, too, Asahi!

05:09.320 --> 05:12.540
Ouch. What was I...

05:13.290 --> 05:17.050
Now, let's open the door
siblings are forbidden to enter.

05:18.710 --> 05:20.340
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

05:20.340 --> 05:22.840
What do you mean? It's a sign of our love.

05:22.840 --> 05:25.510
Enough already! Get away 
from me! This is embarrassing!

05:25.770 --> 05:31.210
What?! Where'd the pure, angelic Asahi
 who dearly loves his sister go?!

05:31.210 --> 05:32.910
That guy doesn't exist!

05:34.750 --> 05:40.400
My Asahi... My sweet, angelic Asahi...

05:36.270 --> 05:41.690
Let's see... If I remember right, I was 
watching them dance, then everything went fuzzy...

05:42.020 --> 05:42.900
That's it!

05:43.160 --> 05:46.110
That dance induces a
 confusion-type status effect!

05:46.110 --> 05:47.110
Confusion?

05:47.110 --> 05:50.370
I see. So that's why Asahi did that just now.

05:51.080 --> 05:52.830
What a splendid technique!

05:52.830 --> 05:56.340
Okay! So all I have to do is take 
them down before they start dancing!

05:56.910 --> 05:58.260
I won't let you!

05:58.260 --> 05:58.870
Why?

05:58.870 --> 06:00.300
Hey there, you guys.

06:00.970 --> 06:05.340
That was a wonderful dance 
you did earlier! It spoke to my heart!

06:06.110 --> 06:09.090
So I'd really like to see it again, okay?

06:11.050 --> 06:12.930
If you value your lives, dance.

06:14.010 --> 06:15.300
Ow.

06:15.300 --> 06:17.960
Why'd she suddenly 
slide tackle me like that?

06:17.960 --> 06:20.600
Asahi! Look this way!

06:26.320 --> 06:28.410
Maya-oneechan!

06:28.410 --> 06:30.470
Thank you!

06:31.690 --> 06:36.020
You're so cute. This time, we have to 
be careful you don't bump your head.

06:37.840 --> 06:39.640
Asahi, do you like me patting your head?

06:39.640 --> 06:42.000
Yeah! Oh, but you know...

06:42.340 --> 06:46.700
I like everything you do 
for me, Maya-oneechan!

06:49.810 --> 06:51.760
Wh-What was I doing?

06:51.760 --> 06:53.380
Dance please!

06:59.300 --> 07:04.090
That was a close one. He's just so darling, 
my emotions came flowing out of my nose.

07:04.890 --> 07:06.320
What's wrong, Asahi?

07:06.320 --> 07:08.030
My head hurts.

07:08.030 --> 07:09.820
What? That's terrible!

07:10.460 --> 07:13.310
Oneechan, your lap feels so soft!

07:13.780 --> 07:16.700
There, there. I'll take care 
of you as much as you like.

07:16.700 --> 07:21.130
<i>Oh, this sweet moment in time...
 May it last forever!</i>

07:21.450 --> 07:22.720
Oneechan.

07:23.930 --> 07:27.260
There's one more thing I want to ask you for.

07:27.260 --> 07:28.220
What is it?

07:28.870 --> 07:29.940
The thing is...

07:30.250 --> 07:34.180
I... Maya-oneechan, 
I want you to be my bride.

07:36.770 --> 07:40.600
I want you to be my bride.

07:44.560 --> 07:48.940
Groom, do you swear to love your wife?

07:48.940 --> 07:50.350
I do.

07:50.350 --> 07:54.720
Bride, do you swear to love your husband?

07:55.150 --> 07:56.280
I do.

07:59.580 --> 08:00.970
Congratulations!

08:00.970 --> 08:02.500
Congratulations!

08:02.500 --> 08:04.660
Congrats, you two!

08:04.660 --> 08:06.340
Be happy!

08:06.580 --> 08:09.190
Thank you! Thank you, everyone!

08:09.720 --> 08:13.970
I'm the happiest big sister in the world!

08:18.290 --> 08:20.020
I am Brondeth!

08:20.020 --> 08:23.560
I serve one of the Demon King's Six Generals,
 Giganto of the Hundred Beasts.

08:23.940 --> 08:26.230
<i>Tch. This jerk has no sense of timing.</i>

08:23.940 --> 08:27.520
On learning of the death of 
my brother, Stelopeth, I have...

08:26.230 --> 08:30.670
<i>I'm busy snuggling with my pure, 
cure-all angel, Asahi, right now!</i>

08:29.690 --> 08:32.190
Ready yourselves, humans!

08:32.190 --> 08:35.780
Asahi, leave this fool to me. 
You go hide somewhere!

08:36.530 --> 08:39.190
You villain! I'll fight you!

08:39.190 --> 08:40.540
A-Asahi?!

08:40.540 --> 08:42.540
Stay away from my oneechan!

08:44.860 --> 08:47.100
You have a lot of pluck, boy.

08:47.100 --> 08:49.030
But what can <i>you</i> possibly do?

08:49.030 --> 08:51.460
Look, your legs are shaking.

08:51.950 --> 08:53.550
No, they're not!

08:53.780 --> 08:55.550
Go away!

09:01.100 --> 09:04.260
What's wrong? You done already?

09:05.390 --> 09:07.310
Begone, weakling.

09:07.310 --> 09:11.190
The only one who can oppose me 
is the hero who bested Stelopeth.

09:11.190 --> 09:14.980
I have no time for a crybaby like you.

09:18.280 --> 09:21.430
You're gonna get blown away, kid!

09:22.520 --> 09:23.580
What?!

09:24.420 --> 09:26.920
You just scoffed at Asahi's bravery.

09:30.900 --> 09:34.300
Big Sis Flare of Rage!

09:42.890 --> 09:47.380
Fool. Do you now realize what 
happens to those who mock Asahi?

09:47.380 --> 09:51.690
Now, are you all right, Asahi? 
You shouldn't do dangerous things like that.

09:54.740 --> 09:56.000
Asahi?

09:56.000 --> 09:57.200
Asahi, what's wrong?

09:57.200 --> 09:58.370
Are you hurt?

09:58.370 --> 10:01.780
Th-The scary thing's gone, 
so you don't have to worry anymore!

10:02.190 --> 10:05.660
I couldn't do anything this time, either.

10:05.890 --> 10:06.940
What?

10:06.940 --> 10:09.780
That time with the doggie,
and this time, too...

10:09.780 --> 10:12.210
I couldn't protect you, Oneechan.

10:12.640 --> 10:15.560
I'm such a weak coward.

10:20.220 --> 10:22.450
Asahi, you aren't weak or a coward.

10:22.450 --> 10:24.220
As your big sister, I guarantee it.

10:24.640 --> 10:25.860
Really?

10:25.860 --> 10:26.980
Yes.

10:27.640 --> 10:32.030
You're kind and always thinking of others. 
When someone's in trouble, you jump in.

10:32.520 --> 10:34.900
That's the kind of brave, 
cool person you're becoming.

10:39.590 --> 10:41.200
Okay! I'll do my best!

10:41.200 --> 10:42.990
I'll work hard and get strong!

10:43.520 --> 10:48.170
And when I'm big and strong, I'll be able to 
protect the Maya-oneesan I love so much!

10:48.650 --> 10:49.810
Asahi...

10:51.370 --> 10:54.420
But there's no need to 
rush to grow up, okay?

10:54.420 --> 10:57.510
Your big sis will feel lonely if you 
don't have to rely on her anymore.

10:57.510 --> 10:58.260
Huh?

11:01.430 --> 11:02.740
Asahi!

11:02.740 --> 11:04.900
And just when the mood was so perfect.

11:04.900 --> 11:07.400
You guys, do your dance one more time, please.

11:09.940 --> 11:11.690
You guys?!

11:12.020 --> 11:15.130
M-My attack got them, too?

11:19.820 --> 11:24.200
No matter how powerful I may be, 
I am powerless in this situation.

11:24.620 --> 11:27.330
But do not give up hope, Ikusaba Maya!

11:26.030 --> 11:26.160
<b>Sister</b>

11:26.160 --> 11:26.240
<b>Sister</b>

11:26.240 --> 11:26.330
<b>Sister</b>

11:26.330 --> 11:27.330
<b>Sister</b>

11:27.820 --> 11:33.830
This is it. Instead of simple strength, 
use that "Sister Power" you're so proud of!

11:32.120 --> 11:33.830
<b>LITTLE BROTHER</b>

11:35.840 --> 11:37.170
Ouch.

11:37.170 --> 11:39.590
I have a crazy huge lump back here.

11:39.590 --> 11:43.340
Why's it look like a serious battle 
took place here?! It's freaking me out!

11:43.340 --> 11:45.270
What the heck happened here?

11:45.270 --> 11:46.840
Oh, right. Where's Maya-nee?

11:55.360 --> 11:57.020
Why are you dancing?

11:59.130 --> 12:00.990
How was that, Asahi?

12:01.290 --> 12:02.380
Are you confused?

12:02.380 --> 12:04.490
I'm completely baffled!

12:06.730 --> 12:08.830
You seem down, Maya-nee.

12:08.830 --> 12:11.430
What's wrong? Let's hurry on home.

12:11.120 --> 12:12.540
<b>You Have Obtained a Meteorite Fragment!</b>

12:11.430 --> 12:12.540
Yeah.

12:13.170 --> 12:14.560
By the way, Asahi...

12:16.830 --> 12:19.760
"Maya-oneechan, I love you!" 
Could you just say that for me?

12:19.760 --> 12:21.380
Where's this coming from? No.

12:22.410 --> 12:26.260
I see. That's a shame. 
I curse my powerlessness.

12:26.260 --> 12:30.140
Seriously, what's this about? You're acting
stranger than usual today, Maya-nee.

12:30.140 --> 12:34.230
I'm just so insignificant.
So incompetent. I'm hopeless.

12:34.230 --> 12:35.270
Maya-nee.

12:36.800 --> 12:39.640
I honestly have no idea what happened,

12:39.640 --> 12:43.070
but I rely on you all the time, Maya-nee.

12:43.430 --> 12:46.820
So please don't call yourself incompetent.

12:47.610 --> 12:48.800
Asahi.

12:50.590 --> 12:53.830
I-It's just... You know...
Maya-nee, you're...

12:53.830 --> 12:57.410
You've always been the person I look up to.

13:00.920 --> 13:04.340
For some reason, I'm hungry. 
I feel like hamburger steak.

13:04.340 --> 13:07.420
The hamburger steak Maya-nee 
makes is the bomb, after all.

13:09.100 --> 13:10.390
Asahi!

13:10.390 --> 13:12.060
Asahi!

13:10.390 --> 13:12.600
Wh-What're you doing, Maya-nee?!

13:12.600 --> 13:15.100
The regular Asahi is the best, after all!

13:15.380 --> 13:21.070
<i>Then or now, my little bro's the cutest
 and best little brother in the world!</i>

13:15.610 --> 13:18.290
What do you mean, the "regular" one?

13:18.290 --> 13:20.040
And you're too <i>close</i>!

13:20.040 --> 13:22.170
Are you listening, Maya-nee?

13:21.300 --> 13:26.680
All right! Today, I'm gonna make my special
hamburger steak, packed full of love!

13:26.680 --> 13:29.820
Okay already! Just get off me!

