13:30.990 --> 13:33.990
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

13:34.000 --> 13:36.470
Hello. Is Tanya here?

13:36.470 --> 13:39.840
I'm sorry. She's taken the day off.

13:39.840 --> 13:42.250
Huh? That's unusual.

13:42.250 --> 13:45.070
Well, you see, she's going on a date today.

13:45.070 --> 13:45.510
A...

13:45.770 --> 13:46.880
A date?

13:48.000 --> 13:51.730
<i>If it's a date, then that means... 
Tanya has a boyfriend?</i>

13:51.730 --> 13:54.020
<i>Wait, why am I feeling 
all shook up about this?</i>

13:56.600 --> 13:59.300
<i>Guess I'll just wander around
 and look for Sieg-san.</i>

13:59.300 --> 14:00.820
<i>He's got no job, so he'll be free.</i>

14:00.820 --> 14:02.230
Hey!

14:04.490 --> 14:06.150
Hi! What a coincidence.

14:06.150 --> 14:08.470
Huh? And, uh, who might you be?

14:08.470 --> 14:09.820
It's me, Tanya.

14:09.820 --> 14:11.120
T-Tanya?!

14:11.120 --> 14:15.160
What's this? Have you forgotten 
the insignificant guild receptionist?

14:15.160 --> 14:17.080
It-It's not like that! It's just...

14:17.080 --> 14:20.540
Th-This is the first time I've seen you
 outside your uniform.

14:21.840 --> 14:24.630
Oh? And you couldn't help but stare?

14:24.630 --> 14:26.340
Wh-Who was?

14:26.340 --> 14:29.500
S-Since we're on the subject, 
I heard you were going on a date today.

14:29.500 --> 14:33.220
Oh, did my seniors at the guild tell you that?

14:34.540 --> 14:36.810
Come on out and say hello.

14:38.740 --> 14:40.160
My little brother, Roy.

14:40.160 --> 14:41.620
L-Little brother?!

14:42.490 --> 14:44.470
This is what they meant by a "date"?

14:45.400 --> 14:48.100
So wait, Tanya, you're a big sister character?

14:48.100 --> 14:51.420
What do you mean by "character"? 
I'm a legit big sister.

14:51.410 --> 14:54.280
<b>Big Brother</b>

14:51.420 --> 14:54.850
I thought you were a lively, 
sweet-talking little sister character.

14:54.850 --> 14:56.160
Oh. Is that right?

14:59.540 --> 15:01.670
If you want, you can hold it for a bit.

15:03.170 --> 15:06.360
Oh, sorry. He's shy around strangers.

15:06.360 --> 15:10.220
You're a sunny, outgoing gyaru,
 but your little brother's reserved.

15:10.220 --> 15:11.940
You're complete opposites.

15:11.940 --> 15:14.180
<i>But I guess we're sort of like that, too.</i>

15:14.550 --> 15:17.480
Roy-kun, do you have any particular likes?

15:19.650 --> 15:22.420
Despite how he acts, 
he likes hearing about adventurers.

15:23.210 --> 15:25.730
To get him interested in the outside world,

15:25.730 --> 15:28.820
we tell him all <i>kinds</i> of 
stories about adventurers!

15:29.060 --> 15:30.920
Then, have you heard of me?

15:30.920 --> 15:33.170
I'm the adventurer known as Ikusaba Asahi.

15:33.170 --> 15:34.570
It's nice to meet you, Roy-kun.

15:34.840 --> 15:36.080
Asahi?

15:36.080 --> 15:38.400
Mister, are you really <i>that</i> Asahi-kun?

15:38.400 --> 15:39.540
"Th-That"?

15:39.540 --> 15:44.380
Oh, wow! You're the rising star! 
The Ogre Class adventurer, Asahi-kun!

15:44.380 --> 15:45.680
Uh, yeah...

15:45.680 --> 15:48.420
My big sister's told me lots about you!

15:49.150 --> 15:52.430
"Asahi-kun's <i>so</i> amazing!" 
She says that every day—

15:53.310 --> 15:57.330
I don't say it <i>all</i> the time. Not every day. 
Only every so often. Rarely, in fact.

15:57.330 --> 15:58.390
R-Right.

15:59.160 --> 16:03.850
You're an up-and-coming adventurer. You even
 defeated one of the Demon King's Six Generals!

16:03.850 --> 16:05.730
You're so cool!

16:05.730 --> 16:07.520
You're embarrassing me...

16:07.520 --> 16:09.360
<b>All of that</b>

16:07.520 --> 16:09.360
<b>was my sister</b>

16:07.520 --> 16:09.360
<i>After all, I didn't do any of it.</i>

16:09.360 --> 16:12.860
Oh, um, leaving that aside... 
You took today off, right?

16:13.110 --> 16:15.950
Why are you so near your workplace?

16:15.950 --> 16:18.880
Well, you see, I'm on the 
other end of the requests today!

16:18.880 --> 16:22.270
I need to go do something in the 
next town over, so I require an escort.

16:22.270 --> 16:23.750
That makes sense.

16:23.980 --> 16:25.310
Oneechan.

16:25.700 --> 16:26.810
What is it, Roy?

16:26.810 --> 16:28.960
Why don't you ask Asahi-kun to be your escort?

16:28.960 --> 16:32.760
Great idea! With Ogre Class Asahi-kun 
by our side, it'll be like having 100 men!

16:32.760 --> 16:34.220
E-Escort?!

16:34.220 --> 16:37.230
<i>This is bad. If we encounter 
monsters on the way,</i>

16:37.230 --> 16:41.020
<i>she'll find out I'm not that strong.
That I'm actually really weak!</i>

16:41.020 --> 16:42.280
<i>And then...</i>

16:42.280 --> 16:45.750
Asahi-kun, you faked your rank.
 You're really just Cannon Fodder class.

16:45.750 --> 16:49.070
Was it fun deceiving everyone? 
I'm very disappointed.

16:49.470 --> 16:50.510
Liar.

16:50.510 --> 16:52.780
<i>No! I'd never recover from that!</i>

16:52.780 --> 16:55.490
<i>If that were to ever happen, 
death would be my only option!</i>

16:55.490 --> 16:57.590
Go on, Roy. Ask him properly.

16:58.030 --> 17:00.290
Please?

17:01.720 --> 17:03.120
<i>That expectant gaze!</i>

17:04.800 --> 17:06.890
I-If you don't mind 
having someone like me...

17:06.890 --> 17:08.590
Yay! Hooray!

17:08.590 --> 17:11.030
You're so amazing, Asahi-kun!
You catch on real quick.

17:11.030 --> 17:13.220
If Asahi-kun's with us, we'll be safe!

17:13.220 --> 17:14.330
<i>I'm worried.</i>

17:14.970 --> 17:18.550
Asahi-kun, thanks for taking 
this job on. It's a huge help.

17:18.550 --> 17:21.890
Not at all. You're always helping me out.

17:21.890 --> 17:23.920
What? No, I'm not.

17:23.920 --> 17:28.810
Besides, if a kid like Roy asks, 
then as his elder, I can't say no.

17:29.850 --> 17:31.680
I can feel the caliber of person you are!

17:32.870 --> 17:36.170
<i>After more thought, strong monsters
 won't appear on the main road,</i>

17:36.170 --> 17:39.230
<i>so nothing should happen to destroy 
the image they have of me.</i>

17:39.230 --> 17:40.240
<i>I've got this.</i>

17:40.710 --> 17:45.500
Roy-kun, you haven't been out of town much, 
right? What do you think of the outside world?

17:47.710 --> 17:48.630
Oh dear.

17:48.460 --> 17:50.590
H-He's not very quick to open up.

17:51.900 --> 17:56.800
He seems to really admire adventurers and 
their stories, so I think he's just feeling shy.

17:57.570 --> 18:00.340
<i>She really is a big sister.</i>

18:02.310 --> 18:03.810
What's that?

18:03.810 --> 18:05.730
A-A wyvern?!

18:06.230 --> 18:09.730
<i>Hey, now! That's not the kind of monster 
that appears on main roads!</i>

18:11.370 --> 18:13.690
Oh no! Tanya! Roy-kun!

18:15.960 --> 18:17.110
Ouch.

18:17.110 --> 18:18.780
Are you two all right?

18:18.780 --> 18:21.050
Seems like it. Roy's fine, too.

18:22.280 --> 18:23.080
Help us!

18:23.080 --> 18:25.750
Hey! Don't leave your 
customers and run away!

18:29.120 --> 18:31.800
This is bad. We need to get away.

18:34.090 --> 18:36.760
I can't stand up, Oneechan!

18:35.660 --> 18:39.880
It's all right, Roy. Asahi-kun's Ogre Class. 
He'll beat it, no problem!

18:39.880 --> 18:40.700
Really?

18:40.700 --> 18:41.560
Of course.

18:42.800 --> 18:45.390
<i>It's that expectant gaze again, only stronger!</i>

18:45.390 --> 18:47.650
<i>But I'm telling you, 
I've got no chance of winning!</i>

18:47.650 --> 18:50.490
It's all right. It's all right, okay?

18:52.570 --> 18:54.610
Your big sister is here with you.

18:58.520 --> 18:59.790
<i>I see now.</i>

19:00.480 --> 19:03.240
<i>This time, it's my turn to do the protecting.</i>

19:10.920 --> 19:12.790
<i>That didn't do anything at all.</i>

19:14.810 --> 19:15.750
A Breath attack?

19:19.010 --> 19:21.370
Then, now's the time!

19:20.930 --> 19:22.260
<b>Skill Owned</b>

19:20.930 --> 19:22.260
<b>Stone-Throwing</b>

19:25.470 --> 19:27.570
All right! That did something!

19:28.030 --> 19:28.730
Uh-oh.

19:40.330 --> 19:41.770
I-Is this...

19:43.890 --> 19:45.600
Does this mean I beat it?

19:45.600 --> 19:47.500
You're amazing, Asahi-kun!

19:47.500 --> 19:49.080
Wow! You're so cool!

19:49.400 --> 19:51.350
Y-You think so?

19:51.780 --> 19:52.790
But...

19:52.790 --> 19:56.040
I was so scared, I couldn't do anything.

19:56.890 --> 20:01.800
A weak coward like me could 
never become someone like you.

20:02.150 --> 20:03.130
Roy...

20:05.210 --> 20:06.230
Roy.

20:07.340 --> 20:08.710
That's not true.

20:08.710 --> 20:12.940
I used to be a crybaby who relied 
on my big sister for everything.

20:12.940 --> 20:14.180
You're lying.

20:14.180 --> 20:15.190
It's the truth.

20:15.930 --> 20:18.230
All you have to do is work hard, Roy.

20:18.650 --> 20:21.740
So that one day, you can 
protect your big sister.

20:21.740 --> 20:23.680
Asahi-kun...

20:24.970 --> 20:28.290
Yeah. Yeah! I'll work really hard!

20:28.290 --> 20:29.120
Okay.

20:30.920 --> 20:32.370
Asahi-kun.

20:33.470 --> 20:36.580
Thanks for protecting me and Roy.

20:37.980 --> 20:38.840
Sure.

20:42.710 --> 20:44.100
Hey, Oneechan.

20:44.100 --> 20:45.190
Wh-What is it?

20:45.190 --> 20:49.560
The wagon's broken and the horse 
is gone. How do we get back?

20:49.560 --> 20:53.040
Oh, that's true. Hm, what should we do?

20:53.040 --> 20:55.060
In that case, let's walk back together.

20:55.060 --> 20:57.980
Yeah. We're not that far 
from town, after all.

20:57.980 --> 20:59.570
Really? Yay!

20:59.910 --> 21:01.190
It's an adventure!

21:01.190 --> 21:01.940
Hey!

21:01.940 --> 21:02.570
Oh my.

21:04.570 --> 21:06.950
Hey! I hope more monsters show up!

21:06.950 --> 21:09.780
That way, I'll get to see 
Asahi-kun being all cool again!

21:09.780 --> 21:10.560
What?!

21:10.560 --> 21:14.590
That's true. Like one of the Six Generals!
 Asahi-kun might even one-hit kill them!

21:18.330 --> 21:20.550
You were defeated by Asahi.

21:20.550 --> 21:22.500
Yes. That's right, isn't it?

21:26.630 --> 21:29.190
You've grown up so much, Asahi.

21:31.070 --> 21:33.250
Tonight, we should celebrate.

23:04.330 --> 23:05.440
I'm home!

23:05.440 --> 23:07.690
Welcome back! You're late today, Asahi.

23:07.690 --> 23:11.660
Yeah, a lot happened today. Actually, I...

23:13.030 --> 23:15.000
Wh-What's with the cake?

23:15.520 --> 23:16.690
It's to celebrate.

23:16.690 --> 23:19.170
Huh? Is today an anniversary or something?

23:19.170 --> 23:20.960
Something made me happy, that's all.

23:20.960 --> 23:22.700
Really? What happened?

23:23.610 --> 23:24.880
That...

23:24.880 --> 23:25.770
is a secret!

23:25.770 --> 23:28.650
What? That just makes me 
<i>more</i> curious. Come on, tell me.

23:28.650 --> 23:30.420
It's a secret only your big sis can know.

23:30.420 --> 23:32.570
Honestly, Maya-nee, you're just so...

23:36.560 --> 23:37.610
<b>Next Time</b>

23:36.970 --> 23:40.350
Next time: "I Can't Raise My Sword Against a Girl."

23:37.650 --> 23:37.820
<b>Episode 8</b>

23:37.940 --> 23:41.980
<b>Episode 8</b>

23:38.270 --> 23:41.980
<b>I Can't Raise My Sword Against a Girl</b>
